<title>THAILAND: Thai Military Bank pays 2.00 baht H2 div.</title>
<headline>Thai Military Bank pays 2.00 baht H2 div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for the six months ended December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			Six months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  2.00  vs  1.80</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 7, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	April 11, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Thai Military Bank Plc, a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
